# Server Integration

The live webpage is Apache on Ubuntu:

  http://117.203.102.123:8088/tlng/wx/dist_nowcast.php

Download Nowcast Bulletin is:

  dist_nowcast3.php  →  attachment filename telangana_nowcast.docx

That PHP script is on the IMD Apache host under /var/www/html/tlng/wx/.
This Python project generates IMD_Nowcast_Bulletin.docx in the repo root.

py generate_bulletin.py copies the generated file to:

  IMD_Nowcast_Bulletin.docx
  telangana_nowcast.docx

and copies dist_nowcast3.php into /var/www/html/tlng/wx when that folder
is writable (when the generator runs on the IMD Apache server), or into
IMD_WX_DIR if that environment variable is set.

The map page itself is not modified.
